  "description": "Unapproved cap1 draft of the source number line and the rightward displacement c from b to a. Modern regularization: a 640 px canvas, clean straight strokes, aligned projection lines and readable Latin labels; layout coordinates are not numerical source coordinates or additional ticks.",
